        <Container class="javax.swing.JScrollPane" name="jScrollPane2">

          <Layout class="org.netbeans.modules.form.compat2.layouts.support.JScrollPaneSupportLayout"/>
          <SubComponents>
            <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="jTextArea1">
              <Properties>
                <Property name="editable" type="boolean" value="false"/>
                <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
                  <Color blue="ff" green="ff" red="cc" type="rgb"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
                <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
                  <Font name="Segoe UI" size="14" style="0"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="lineWrap" type="boolean" value="true"/>
                <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="DENTAL CLINIC SYSTEM - HELP / USER GUIDE&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;1. HOW TO LOGIN&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;1. Enter your username.&#xa;2. Enter your password.&#xa;3. Click the LOGIN button.&#xa;4. If the details are correct, the Dashboard will open.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;2. HOW TO REGISTER PATIENT&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;1. Open Patient Management from the Dashboard.&#xa;2. Enter the patient&apos;s details.&#xa;3. Check that all required fields are filled.&#xa;4. Click SAVE.&#xa;5. The new patient will appear in the patient table.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;3. HOW TO CREATE APPOINTMENT&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;1. Open Appointment Management.&#xa;2. Select or enter the patient.&#xa;3. Select the dentist.&#xa;4. Select the treatment.&#xa;5. Select the appointment date and time.&#xa;6. Enter the required details.&#xa;7. Click SAVE.&#xa;8. The appointment will appear in the appointment table.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;4. HOW TO CREATE BILL&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;1. Open Bill Management.&#xa;2. Select the relevant patient or appointment.&#xa;3. Enter/select the required treatment details.&#xa;4. Check the treatment fee and total amount.&#xa;5. Click SAVE.&#xa;6. The bill will be saved successfully.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;5. HOW TO SEARCH APPOINTMENT&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;1. Open Appointment Management.&#xa;2. Enter or select the search criteria.&#xa;3. Click SEARCH.&#xa;4. The matching appointment records will be displayed in the table.&#xa;5. Select a record to view its details.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;6. HOW TO PRINT BILL&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;1. Open Bill Management.&#xa;2. Search or select the required bill.&#xa;3. Check the bill details.&#xa;4. Click the PRINT button.&#xa;5. Select the required printer.&#xa;6. Confirm printing.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;7. HOW TO LOGOUT&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;1. Complete your work.&#xa;2. Return to the Dashboard.&#xa;3. Click the LOGOUT button.&#xa;4. The system will return to the Login screen.&#xa;5. Do not close the system without logging out.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;IMPORTANT NOTES&#xa;------------------------------&#xa;&#x2022; Always check patient details before saving.&#xa;&#x2022; Check appointment date and time carefully.&#xa;&#x2022; Verify bill amounts before printing.&#xa;&#x2022; Do not share your username or password.&#xa;&#x2022; Logout after completing your work."/>
                <Property name="wrapStyleWord" type="boolean" value="true"/>
              </Properties>
            </Component>
          </SubComponents>
        </Container>
